sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (phone)
    participant M as Miniapp (webview)
    participant B as Backend (VPS :8788)
    participant C as codex CLI (pty, same box)
    participant P as OpenAI OAuth

    U->>M: tap "Connect Codex"
    M->>B: POST /api/auth/codex/start
    B->>C: spawn `codex login` (callback server on 127.0.0.1:1455)
    C-->>B: prints auth URL (captured from pty)
    B-->>M: state=awaiting_approval + authUrl
    M->>P: open authUrl in webview
    U->>P: sign in + approve
    P-->>M: redirect to http://localhost:1455/auth/callback?code=...
    Note over M: dead URL on the phone — the webview<br/>INTERCEPTS it (no copy-paste)
    M->>B: POST /api/auth/codex/callback { url }
    B->>C: replay GET on 127.0.0.1:1455 (same box = it lands)
    C->>P: exchange code for tokens
    C-->>B: exit 0 → probe "codex login status" OK
    B->>B: sync auth.json → acpx/codex-home + trust projects dir
    B-->>M: state=success
    M-->>U: Codex connected ✓
